<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Clenched Fist</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 13)
Mana: 15
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast clenched fist &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast clenched fist</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>With this powerful spell you summon a huge, magical copy of your own fist, 
and crush your opponent with it. The better your magic and your summoning 
sphere, the harder it hits.
</p><p>Being a crushing blow, it does most against plate and chain, and least 
against clothes: the opposite of energy bolt. A shield takes some of the 
blow, but can't stop it. Casting it is an attack and starts a fight, and it 
can also be cast from wands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Energy Bolt</a>
